  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "authentication",
      "title": "Service authentication",
      "items": [
        "The dep client uses OAuth 1.0a to obtain a session token, then sends X-ADM-Auth-Session on device-assignment requests.",
        "axm exchanges an ES256-signed client assertion for an OAuth access token, then uses that token as Bearer authentication on API calls.",
        "Software catalogue lookup uses public HTTPS requests; it does not use the device-assignment or business API credentials.",
        "Apps and Books sends the original location sToken as a bearer credential and checks the returned library UID and MDM identity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Inventory and assignments",
      "items": [
        "Synchronization begins with a full fetch and then incremental cursors. A full-fetch generation reconciles missing devices only at successful completion; page and cursor persistence is atomic.",
        "Synchronization and assignment have independent schedules. The reconciler persists per-device retries, checks the desired target before saving outcomes and reads back Apple state in the reference server.",
        "Apps and Books returns asynchronous event IDs. The caller persists progress, authenticates notifications and checks completion before installation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "policy",
      "title": "Software updates",
      "items": [
        "The enrollment handler applies its configured update policy. Software lookup supplies available versions; it does not itself send the device’s HTTP rejection."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Device assignment — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/device-assignment",
        "Implementing OAuth for the Apple School Manager and Apple Business APIs — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/apple-school-and-business-manager-api/implementing-oauth-for-the-apple-school-manager-and-apple-business-api",
        "ErrorCodeSoftwareUpdateRequired — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/errorcodesoftwareupdaterequired",
        "Apps and Books — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/getting-started-with-the-management-api",
        "ADE session authentication — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/authenticating-for-automated-device-enrollment",
        "Assignment throttling — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/assign-profile"
      ]
    }
  ]
